(7734895, 1270720, 29535, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog! Reminds me of my own.<br/> <br/>My favourite dog portraits are those that really get close on the details of the fur in the face, nice and sharp. Then in a full body like this I''d have loved to see the background further away and therefore out of focus.<br/> <br/>Dogs are reaallly photogenic, you barely need any help from the lighting so you can focus all on composition! I''d love to see more pics of Buddy!</td>', 'Lovely dog! Reminds me of my own. My favourite dog portraits are those that really get close on the details of the fur in the face, nice and sharp. Then in a full body like this I''d have loved to see the background further away and therefore out of focus. Dogs are reaallly photogenic, you barely need any help from the lighting so you can focus all on composition! I''d love to see more pics of Buddy!', '2022-12-18 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 0);
